                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is not recommend at all. This might be real harsh knowing it feels like one or two people made this game but it isn't fun at all. \n\nPicture this, you basically shoot zombies, move to place, shoot more zombies, move to another place, shoot even more zombies and so on. Heck there is even glitches too and bad AI teammates that act stupid to go through one door. I feel like this game should have been more of an Alpha stage to me since there are many things need polishing.\n\nHowever, the third person zombie shooter was pretty neat to start with including how realistic the animation acts with movement and such but it's a real let down to it's gameplay and plot of the story too. It's hard to get interested on what the characters say in the game.",
